cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  This is a C++ port. Please cite the ORIGINAL UMI-tools paper — the science and
  the algorithms are the work of its authors, not of this reimplementation.
title: "umi_tools-cpp: a validated C++ port of UMI-tools"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A C++ reimplementation of UMI-tools, validated unit by unit against the live
  Python implementation. Produced with substantial AI assistance; see the
  README's disclosure section for the evidence and the Limitations section for the
  enumerated deviations.
references:
  - type: article
    title: >-
      UMI-tools: modeling sequencing errors in Unique Molecular Identifiers to
      improve quantification accuracy
    authors:
      - family-names: Smith
        given-names: Tom
      - family-names: Heger
        given-names: Andreas
      - family-names: Sudbery
        given-names: Ian
    journal: Genome Research
    year: 2017
    volume: 27
    issue: 3
    start: 491
    end: 499
    doi: 10.1101/gr.209601.116
